INSERT INTO `invoice_items` VALUES (1,1.00,'1Gypsum Partition Work – Supply and installation of fire-rated gypsum board with rockwool partitions including GI tube with metal studs, channels, joints finishing as per approved drawings.',1.00,50000.00,50000.00),(2,2.00,'Sl No	Description	Remarks 1	Footing beam – 160 RM, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 2	RCC columns – 56 Nos, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 3	Block masonry – 160 m perimeter, height 3 m	Hollow blocks 4	Wall plastering – internal & external	Complete finish',1.00,105000.00,105000.00),(3,3.00,'Supply & Installation of Normal Gypsum Ceiling — Other Area, Level A (same height as reception) (SQM)  93	﷼80.00	﷼7,440.00 Supply & Installation of Normal Gypsum Ceiling — Other Area, Level B (lower/dropped) ( SQM)',1.00,9915.00,9915.00),(4,4.00,'Networking',1.00,4660.00,4660.00),(5,5.00,'SUPPLY AND INSTALLATION SPC FLOORING',51.29,70.00,3590.30),(6,6.00,'GI Frame Work with Primer & 6 mm Fiberglass Installation – Work Description  Supply, fabricate, and install GI sub-frame work using approved quality galvanized iron (GI) sections, including all necessary vertical and horizontal members, properly aligned, leveled, and securely fixed to the existing structure.  The GI framework shall be cleaned and applied with one coat of anti-rust primer to ensure corrosion protection and durability.  Supply and fix 6 mm fiberglass sheets to the GI framework, cut to size and properly aligned, including all necessary fasteners, accessories, joints, and finishing to achieve a neat and uniform appearance.  Scope includes:  GI sub-frame supply & installation  Anti-rust primer coat to GI members  6 mm fiberglass sheet fixing  All fittings, anchors, screws, and consumables  Complete installation with proper finishing  Work executed as per site conditions, drawings, and approved standards  Complete in all respects, ready for inspection and use',1.00,7550.00,7550.00),(7,7.00,'Supply and laying of CAT6 data cable from the server/NVR room to each CCTV camera location.  Total 16 CCTV camera points.  15	﷼125.00	﷼1,875.00 supply and installation ip camara dome  12	﷼75.00	﷼900.00 HDD  1	﷼550.00	﷼550.00 20 channel NVR with Poe  1	﷼1,100.00	﷼1,100.00 Supply and installation focal cemara for cash counter  2	﷼235.00	﷼470.00 Configuration & System Setup , Cemera Installation Initial system configuration of NVR Camera channel setup and naming Date & time configuration Recording mode setup (continuous / motion-based / scheduled) Resolution and frame rate optimization Motion detection and alert configuration User account creation and password setup  1	﷼850.00	﷼850.00 SMART TV USED ONE 42 inc  1	﷼350.00	﷼350.00 HDMI cable 15 mtr  1	﷼145.00	﷼145.00',0.00,6200.00,0.00),(8,8.00,'Supply and installation ip camera 4 mp Configuration',1.00,350.00,350.00),(9,8.00,'Maintenance camera con connecter replied',1.00,135.00,135.00),(10,9.00,'Networking',1.00,4660.00,4660.00),(11,10.00,'Remove damaged/broken existing floor tiles Clean and prepare the base surface Fix new floor tiles with adhesive Grouting, finishing, and cleaning Handover in neat and usable condition',1.00,850.00,850.00),(12,11.00,'Wooden Door Realignment  Realignment of the existing wooden door because the door is touching the floor.  Includes adjustment of hinges, trimming if required, and ensuring smooth door movement.  Final check and proper alignment after installation',1.00,875.00,875.00),(13,12.00,'Aluminum Door Floor Machine Replacement – Scope of Work Scope of Work:  1. Existing Floor Machine Removal Carefully remove the existing faulty floor spring. Remove floor cover plate and disconnect the door from the pivot.  Clean the floor pocket and remove old debris/loose concrete. 2. Supply & Installation of New Floor Machine  Provide new heavy-duty floor spring suitable for aluminum/glass doors (100–120kg capacity or as required).  Fix the new floor machine in correct alignment level. Add proper cement packing to secure the box firmly. Install new top pivot/patch if required. 3. Door Alignment & Adjustment Re-install the door on the new floor spring. Adjust opening/closing tension and speed. Ensure smooth operation without noise or jerking. 4. Finishing Work Re-fix stainless steel cover plate. Apply silicone sealing around edges if required. Cleaning and final testing in front of client.',1.00,1500.00,1500.00),(14,13.00,'SUPPLY AND INSTALLATION SPC FLOORING',51.29,70.00,3590.30),(15,14.00,'Scope of Work – Floor Epoxy Repair & Recoating  1. Surface Preparation  Inspect the existing epoxy floor for damaged, peeled, or cracked areas. Grind/scrape the damaged epoxy surface to remove all loose material. Repair cracks, holes, and uneven surfaces using epoxy filler/putty. Clean the entire floor area thoroughly (dust-free ) before coating.  2. Epoxy Coating Application  Apply 1st coat of high-quality epoxy primer/epoxy base coat. After drying, apply 2nd coat of epoxy topcoat with uniform finish. Ensure proper curing time between coats for durability and smooth appearance.  3. Epoxy Skirting  Apply epoxy skirting around the wall edges (standard height as required). Ensure neat finishing between floor and wall joint.  4. Final Inspection & Handover Check entire area for proper bonding, smoothness, and color consistency. Final cleaning after completion of work. Handover area ready for use after curing time.',1.00,10000.00,10000.00),(16,15.00,'Light replacement work at 1st floor, including removal of existing faulty light fittings and supply & installation of new lights, complete with testing',1.00,500.00,500.00),(17,16.00,'Sl No	Description	Remarks 1	Footing beam – 160 RM, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 2	RCC columns – 56 Nos, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 3	Block masonry – 160 m perimeter, height 3 m	Hollow blocks 4	Wall plastering – internal & external	Complete finish',1.00,105000.00,105000.00),(18,17.00,'Sl No	Description	Remarks 1	Footing beam – 160 RM, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 2	RCC columns – 56 Nos, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 3	Block masonry – 160 m perimeter, height 3 m	Hollow blocks 4	Wall plastering – internal & external	Complete finish',1.00,105000.00,105000.00),(19,19.00,'Supply and laying of CAT6 data cable from the server/NVR room to each CCTV camera location.',14.00,125.00,1750.00),(20,19.00,'supply  ip camara dome',12.00,75.00,900.00),(21,19.00,'HDD',1.00,550.00,550.00),(22,19.00,'20 channel NVR with Poe',1.00,1120.00,1120.00),(23,19.00,'Supply  focal cemara for cash counter',2.00,225.00,450.00),(24,19.00,'Configuration & System Setup , Cemera Installation  Initial system configuration of  NVR  Camera channel setup and naming  Date & time configuration  Recording mode setup (continuous / motion-based / scheduled)  Resolution and frame rate optimization  Motion detection and alert configuration  User account creation and password setup',1.00,750.00,750.00),(25,19.00,'SMART TV USED ONE 42 inc',1.00,350.00,350.00),(26,19.00,'HDMI cable  !15 mtr',1.00,145.00,145.00),(27,20.00,'Networking',1.00,1600.00,1600.00),(28,21.00,'Supply and laying of CAT6 data cable from the server/NVR room to each CCTV camera location.',14.00,125.00,1750.00),(29,21.00,'supply  ip camara dome',12.00,75.00,900.00),(30,21.00,'HDD',1.00,550.00,550.00),(31,21.00,'20 channel NVR with Poe',1.00,1120.00,1120.00),(32,21.00,'Supply  focal cemara for cash counter',2.00,225.00,450.00),(33,21.00,'Configuration & System Setup , Cemera Installation  Initial system configuration of  NVR  Camera channel setup and naming  Date & time configuration  Recording mode setup (continuous / motion-based / scheduled)  Resolution and frame rate optimization  Motion detection and alert configuration  User account creation and password setup',1.00,750.00,750.00),(34,21.00,'SMART TV USED ONE 42 inc',1.00,350.00,350.00),(35,21.00,'HDMI cable  !15 mtr',1.00,145.00,145.00),(36,22.00,'Scope of Work : Design, supply, fabrication and installation of a custom wooden restaurant counter/unit suitable for station use, complete with finishing and accessories as specified. Dimensions:  Length- 68 cm  Width- 87 cm  Height -  91 cm . Material : High Quailty MDF',1.00,2300.00,2300.00),(37,23.00,'Gypsum Partition Works Supply & installation of normal gypsum partitions Complete system with metal studs, tracks, joints & finishing',49.50,85.00,4207.50),(38,23.00,'Painting Works – New Partition Areas Surface preparation + primer + 2 finish coats',99.00,15.00,1485.00),(39,23.00,'Ceiling Works (Suspended Ceiling) Supply & installation including grids and boards',22.50,55.00,1237.50),(40,23.00,'Supply and insttlation glass door frameless with floor machine',3.00,1150.00,3450.00),(41,24.00,'Kitchen Floor Repair Work – Scope  Remove damaged/broken existing floor tiles  Clean and prepare the base surface  Fix new floor tiles with adhesive  Grouting, finishing, and cleaning  Handover in neat and usable condition',1.00,950.00,950.00),(42,25.00,'Supply of round wooden table size 70 × 70 cm with solid wood top, steel base, and high-quality PU paint finish (including primer, base coat, and top coat), complete with fabrication, assembly, and ready for installation.',4.00,750.00,3000.00),(43,25.00,'Supply of round wooden table suitable for six-person seating capacity, designed with center dividing and movable sections, allowing the table to be joined to form a full round shape or separated into two half-round tables, with solid wood top, steel base, and high-quality PU paint finish (including primer, base coat, and top coat), complete with fabrication, assembly, and ready for installation',6.00,1500.00,9000.00),(44,26.00,'MDF CARVE WALL WITH WHITE PAINT FINISH 2 SIDE WALL',1.00,2750.00,2750.00),(45,27.00,'Fabrication, supply and installation of polished and tempered 12mm thick clear glass inserted in aluminium tubular section (50X50 mm-powder coated Black color) Glass specification: 12mm thick Polished edges and tempered clear glass *Each panel will be divided by as per the model  Frameless Glass Door Fabrication, supply and installation of 12mm thick, polished, and tempered clear glass floor-mounted frameless swing door, including all necessary accessories and fittings Aluminium Section: 50mmX50mm Tubular section -Black powder coated color',1.00,17200.00,17200.00),(46,27.00,'Supply and complete installation of SPC (Stone Polymer Composite) flooring for the required areas including all necessary accessories. Work includes proper surface cleaning, measurement confirmation, cutting, fitting, finishing edges with skirting/trims, and cleaning upon completion.',183.50,65.00,11927.50),(47,28.00,'Scope of Work : Design, supply, fabrication and installation of a custom wooden restaurant counter/unit suitable for station use, complete with finishing and accessories as specified. Dimensions:  Length- 68 cm  Width- 87 cm  Height -  91 cm . Material : High Quailty MDF',1.00,2300.00,2300.00),(48,29.00,'Scope of Work : Design, supply, fabrication and installation of a custom wooden restaurant counter/unit suitable for station use, complete with finishing and accessories as specified. Dimensions:  Length- 68 cm  Width- 87 cm  Height -  91 cm . Material : High Quailty MDF',1.00,2300.00,2300.00),(49,30.00,'Scope of Work : Design, supply, fabrication and installation of a custom wooden restaurant counter/unit suitable for station use, complete with finishing and accessories as specified. Dimensions:  Length- 68 cm  Width- 87 cm  Height -  91 cm . Material : High Quailty MDF',1.00,2000.00,2000.00),(50,31.00,'Scope of Work: 1. Steel Structure Frame Fabrication & installation of MS steel frame structure Finish: Anti-rust primer + epoxy/PU paint Designed to support glass walls and roof 2. Glass Wall with Frame System 6mm fiberglass glass panels Fixed on powder-coated aluminum/steel framing system All sides glass enclosure Complete beading, gasket, and sealing system 3. Glass Door Framed glass door 6mm fiberglass glass Complete hardware set: Hinges Handle Lock Door stopper 4. Roof Glass 6mm fiberglass glass roof panels Steel support frame Weatherproof silicone sealing',1.00,5875.00,5875.00),(51,32.00,'DEMOLISH AND BUILD WORK',1.00,5700.00,5700.00),(52,33.00,'1. Gypsum Partition Works Scope: Supply and installation of gypsum board partition • GI channel framing with proper support structure • Installation of Rockwool insulation for sound/thermal control • Jointing, taping, and smooth finishing on both sides • Necessary screws, studs, and accessories included • Final surface prepared for painting',304.50,83.00,25273.50),(53,33.00,'Gypsum Ceiling Works – 406 sqm  Scope: Supply and installation of gypsum board ceiling with GI suspension system. Includes hangers, channels, perimeter angle, access panels (where required), and finishing. All cutouts for lights, AC diffusers, and detectors included. Total Area: 406 sqm',406.00,75.00,30450.00),(54,33.00,'Painting Works – 1121.75 sqm Scope: Surface preparation, patching, sanding, primer, and two coats of high-quality emulsion paint. Painting includes all internal walls and ceilings. Includes protection of floors and furniture.',1121.75,16.50,18508.88),(55,33.00,'Wooden Doors – 4 Nos Scope: Supply and installation of wooden doors complete with frames and architraves. Door specification includes: Solid or semi-solid core (as required) Hinges, lockset, handles, stoppers Paint/veneer finish as per design Complete fixing and alignment. Quantity: 4 doors',4.00,1750.00,7000.00),(56,33.00,'General Cleaning & Waste Removal  Scope: Complete site cleaning after all fit-out activities. Removal of construction debris, dust, packing materials, and leftover waste from all working areas. Sweeping, mopping, and wiping down all surfaces, floors, ceilings, doors, glass partitions, and fixtures. Collection, loading, and transportation of waste to an approved disposal location. Final detailed cleaning to hand over the site in neat and ready-to-use condition.',1.00,4000.00,4000.00),(57,33.00,'Supply and installation of cement board partition for bathroom side wall • Complete framing support with necessary channels and accessories • Floor waterproofing with approved waterproofing materials • Backfilling and surface preparation for tiling • installation of floor tiles including grout and spacers • Alignment check and finishing with necessary trims • Final cleaning of tiled surface and work area  *pantry area tile work also',1.00,4200.00,4200.00),(58,33.00,'Supply and insttlation Rockwood ceiling around the wall areas',1.00,6500.00,6500.00),(59,33.00,'Supply and insttlation MS support for all gypsum wall single partition area from floor to ceiling 4*4 tube ( 24)',1.00,2350.00,2350.00),(60,34.00,'Steel wall  work for TV holder',1.00,10000.00,10000.00),(61,35.00,'Scope of Work – Room Shifting, Painting & Electrical Works 1. Furniture Shifting Works (Without Dismantling) Shifting of existing room furniture to basement carefully without dismantling. Protection and safe handling during shifting. After completion of painting works, shifting sofa seats from basement to room. Arrangement of sofa seats and furniture as per client layout.',1.00,1185.00,1185.00),(62,35.00,'Room Painting Works Surface cleaning and preparation. Crack filling on walls and ceiling. Putty application where required. Two (2) coats of premium quality emulsion paint finish for walls and ceiling.',1.00,1500.00,1500.00),(63,35.00,'Staircase Painting Works Crack filling on staircase walls and ceiling. Surface preparation and sanding. Two (2) coats of paint finish on staircase walls and ceiling.',1.00,2750.00,2750.00),(64,35.00,'Electrical Works Supply and installation of new lights Installation of light fittings (as per agreed scope).',1.00,850.00,850.00),(65,36.00,'Scope of Work: Complete Painting Renovation  The work includes complete painting renovation for internal and external wall surfaces.  Supply and delivery of all necessary materials, tools, and equipment.  Rectification of all surface defects, including cracks on walls and boundary walls, using approved crack fillers.  Application of high-quality wall putty to ensure a leveled and smooth surface finish.  Application of two coats of premium-grade paint, ensuring even coverage, color consistency, and a durable, elegant appearance.  All works shall be carried out in accordance with manufacturer recommendations and good painting practices.',1.00,6500.00,6500.00),(66,37.00,'Painting Existing Wall – One Coat and wooden door painting  • Surface preparation (basic cleaning) • One coat of emulsion paint • Protection of nearby surfaces during work • Final touch-up and site cleanup',1.00,3350.00,3350.00),(67,37.00,'Supply and Installation of Door Closer  • Supply of standard door closer • Fixing and alignment on existing door',1.00,125.00,125.00),(68,37.00,'Networking',1.00,7201.00,7201.00),(69,37.00,'Steel Storage Rack with Painted Steel Frame & Laminated MDF Shelves  Supply of storage rack fabricated with steel frame painted and laminated MDF shelves, complete with adjustable shelf levels and all necessary fittings. Suitable for office / storage use.',1.00,1000.00,1000.00),(70,37.00,'Scope of Work Description  Yellow & Black Road Line Marking – Front Side Gate  Supply and application of yellow and black road line marking at the front-side gate area only. The work includes surface cleaning and preparation, masking, and application of durable traffic-grade paint in alternating yellow and black pattern along the designated edge/kerb area. Work completed as per site requirement and safety standards.',1.00,1704.00,1704.00),(71,37.00,'Repair & Supply of Interlock Paving – Front Side Entrance (Left Side)  Supply of 150 Nos. interlock paving blocks and repair/reinstatement of existing interlock paving at the front-side entrance, left-side area. The work includes removal of damaged interlock, surface and base level correction, sand bedding, fixing and alignment of new and existing interlock blocks, joint sand filling, and proper finishing. All works completed as per 