INSERT INTO `quotation_items` VALUES (1,1,'1Gypsum Partition Work – Supply and installation of fire-rated gypsum board with rockwool partitions including GI tube with metal studs, channels, joints finishing as per approved drawings.',1.00,50000.00,50000.00),(42,3,'Sl No	Description	Remarks 1	Footing beam – 160 RM, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 2	RCC columns – 56 Nos, size 20×20 cm	As per quotation 3	Block masonry – 160 m perimeter, height 3 m	Hollow blocks 4	Wall plastering – internal & external	Complete finish',1.00,105000.00,105000.00),(43,4,'Supply & Installation of Normal Gypsum Ceiling — Other Area, Level A (same height as reception) (SQM)  93	﷼80.00	﷼7,440.00 Supply & Installation of Normal Gypsum Ceiling — Other Area, Level B (lower/dropped) ( SQM)',1.00,9915.00,9915.00),(45,6,'SUPPLY AND INSTALLATION SPC FLOORING',51.29,70.00,3590.30),(46,7,'GI Frame Work with Primer & 6 mm Fiberglass Installation – Work Description  Supply, fabricate, and install GI sub-frame work using approved quality galvanized iron (GI) sections, including all necessary vertical and horizontal members, properly aligned, leveled, and securely fixed to the existing structure.  The GI framework shall be cleaned and applied with one coat of anti-rust primer to ensure corrosion protection and durability.  Supply and fix 6 mm fiberglass sheets to the GI framework, cut to size and properly aligned, including all necessary fasteners, accessories, joints, and finishing to achieve a neat and uniform appearance.  Scope includes:  GI sub-frame supply & installation  Anti-rust primer coat to GI members  6 mm fiberglass sheet fixing  All fittings, anchors, screws, and consumables  Complete installation with proper finishing  Work executed as per site conditions, drawings, and approved standards  Complete in all respects, ready for inspection and use',1.00,7550.00,7550.00),(47,8,'Supply and laying of CAT6 data cable from the server/NVR room to each CCTV camera location.  Total 16 CCTV camera points.  15	﷼125.00	﷼1,875.00 supply and installation ip camara dome  12	﷼75.00	﷼900.00 HDD  1	﷼550.00	﷼550.00 20 channel NVR with Poe  1	﷼1,100.00	﷼1,100.00 Supply and installation focal cemara for cash counter  2	﷼235.00	﷼470.00 Configuration & System Setup , Cemera Installation Initial system configuration of NVR Camera channel setup and naming Date & time configuration Recording mode setup (continuous / motion-based / scheduled) Resolution and frame rate optimization Motion detection and alert configuration User account creation and password setup  1	﷼850.00	﷼850.00 SMART TV USED ONE 42 inc  1	﷼350.00	﷼350.00 HDMI cable 15 mtr  1	﷼145.00	﷼145.00',0.00,6200.00,0.00),(48,9,'Paintinge work',1.00,700.00,700.00),(49,10,'Chair bottom cover with wooden cladding and textured paint finish.  Specification:  Base structure: High-quality plywood or MDF board (as per site requirement)  Cladding: Decorative wooden laminate or veneer finish with groove details  Surface finish: Premium-grade textured paint (color and texture as per approved sample)  Edge finish: Smooth sealed edges with matching color  Installation: Complete with all accessories and fixing materials  Workmanship: Neat, uniform finish ensuring durability and aesthetic appeal',42.00,160.00,6720.00),(50,11,'Supply of round wooden table size 70 × 70 cm with solid wood top, steel base, and high-quality PU paint finish (including primer, base coat, and top coat), complete with fabrication, assembly, and ready for installation.',4.00,750.00,3000.00),(51,11,'Supply of round wooden table suitable for six-person seating capacity, designed with center dividing and movable sections, allowing the table to be joined to form a full round shape or separated into two half-round tables, with solid wood top, steel base, and high-quality PU paint finish (including primer, base coat, and top coat), complete with fabrication, assembly, and ready for installation',7.00,1500.00,10500.00),(52,12,'Fixing and strengthening of existing wooden fencing supports by anchoring to the floor using heavy-duty floor bolts. All drilling holes and damaged areas shall be properly filled with putty, leveled, and finished with matching paint to restore a clean and uniform appearance.',1.00,1275.00,1275.00),(53,13,'Supply and installation ip camera 4 mp Configuration',1.00,350.00,350.00),(54,13,'Maintenance camera con connecter replied',1.00,135.00,135.00),(56,14,'Scope of Work  Inspection & Assessment Check existing 60×60 metal ceiling tiles and grid condition Identify loose, damaged, or unsupported areas Re-Arrangement of Ceiling Tiles Remove and refix misaligned/damaged tiles Ensure proper leveling and straight alignment  Support Installation Supply & install GI rods, channels and required fasteners Reinforce unsupported areas to ensure ceiling stability and safety',1.00,1885.00,1885.00),(57,15,'Remove damaged/broken existing floor tiles Clean and prepare the base surface Fix new floor tiles with adhesive Grouting, finishing, and cleaning Handover in neat and usable condition',1.00,850.00,850.00),(58,16,'Wooden Door Realignment  Realignment of the existing wooden door because the door is touching the floor.  Includes adjustment of hinges, trimming if required, and ensuring smooth door movement.  Final check and proper alignment after installation',1.00,875.00,875.00),(60,17,'Aluminum Door Floor Machine Replacement – Scope of Work Scope of Work:  1. Existing Floor Machine Removal Carefully remove the existing faulty floor spring. Remove floor cover plate and disconnect the door from the pivot.  Clean the floor pocket and remove old debris/loose concrete. 2. Supply & Installation of New Floor Machine  Provide new heavy-duty floor spring suitable for aluminum/glass doors (100–120kg capacity or as required).  Fix the new floor machine in correct alignment level. Add proper cement packing to secure the box firmly. Install new top pivot/patch if required. 3. Door Alignment & Adjustment Re-install the door on the new floor spring. Adjust opening/closing tension and speed. Ensure smooth operation without noise or jerking. 4. Finishing Work Re-fix stainless steel cover plate. Apply silicone sealing around edges if required. Cleaning and final testing in front of client.',1.00,1500.00,1500.00),(61,18,'Remove damaged/broken existing floor tiles Clean and prepare the base surface Fix new floor tiles with adhesive Grouting, finishing, and cleaning Handover in neat and usable condition',1.00,850.00,850.00),(62,19,'Basement – Storage Area Scope of Work – Gypsum Partition with Door Installation & Painting  1. Gypsum Partition Construction  Supply and installation of new gypsum board partition.  Framework using GI metal channels.  Proper alignment, leveling, and secure fixing.  Joint treatment, taping, and finishing for a smooth surface.  2. Door Supply & Installation  Wooden door installation within the partition (as per client requirement).  Door frame fixing, hinges, lockset, handle and necessary door accessories.  Smooth operation ensured after installation. 3. Painting Works  Surface preparation including putty and primer for all new partitions and door.  Two coats of quality paint (client-approved color).  Clean and uniform finish.',1.00,3785.00,3785.00),(63,19,'Painting Existing Wall – One Coat and wooden door painting  • Surface preparation (basic cleaning) • One coat of emulsion paint • Protection of nearby surfaces during work • Final touch-up and site cleanup',1.00,3550.00,3550.00),(64,19,'Supply and Installation of Door Closer  • Supply of standard door closer • Fixing and alignment on existing door',1.00,225.00,225.00),(65,20,'Supply and instlation tube lights 18 tube lights insdie the Basement office inside',18.00,20.00,360.00),(66,20,'Supply and instlation tube lights 18 tube lights insdie the Basement Accounts file room inside New 5 full set',5.00,120.00,600.00),(67,20,'Supply and instlation tube lights 18 tube lights insdie the Basement parking area',44.00,20.00,880.00),(68,20,'Supply and installation of electrical switch for 1st floor office',1.00,120.00,120.00),(69,20,'Biometric Door Magnet – Replacement Supply and replacement of existing faulty magnetic lock for the biometric door. Proper mounting and alignment of the new magnet unit. Connection to existing biometric system by qualified technician. Functional testing to ensure secure locking and smooth access control.',1.00,325.00,325.00),(70,20,'Removal Works Carefully remove the existing biometric access device from the warehouse IT room. Disconnect and remove related cabling and accessories as required  Server & UPS Removal Safely shut down, disconnect, and remove the server from its current location.  Transportation Pack and transport the biometric device, server, and UPS to the office location.',1.00,385.00,385.00),(71,21,'Deep Cleaning of Underground Parking Lot – One Time WORK INCLUDES: Full deep cleaning of underground parking area, removal of oil, grease, stains, and washing of floor surfaces.',1.00,3250.00,3250.00),(72,22,'Scope of Work – Floor Epoxy Repair & Recoating  1. Surface Preparation  Inspect the existing epoxy floor for damaged, peeled, or cracked areas. Grind/scrape the damaged epoxy surface to remove all loose material. Repair cracks, holes, and uneven surfaces using epoxy filler/putty. Clean the entire floor area thoroughly (dust-free ) before coating.  2. Epoxy Coating Application  Apply 1st coat of high-quality epoxy primer/epoxy base coat. After drying, apply 2nd coat of epoxy topcoat with uniform finish. Ensure proper curing time between coats for durability and smooth appearance.  3. Epoxy Skirting  Apply epoxy skirting around the wall edges (standard height as required). Ensure neat finishing between floor and wall joint.  4. Final Inspection & Handover Check entire area for proper bonding, smoothness, and color consistency. Final cleaning after completion of work. Handover area ready for use after curing time.',1.00,10000.00,10000.00),(73,23,'Providing and constructing a concrete ramp at the basement elevator area, including surface preparation, formwork, reinforcement, concreting, finishing, and curing — complete as per site requirements.',1.00,1200.00,1200.00),(74,23,'office glass tinting',1.00,1150.00,1150.00),(75,23,'Furniture Dismantling  Carefully dismantle all specified furniture items such as tables, cabinets, wardrobes, shelves, counters, and partitions.  Ensure hardware and accessories (screws, hinges, brackets) are removed safely and stored properly.  Label all dismantled parts for easy re-installation in future.  Packing Work  Pack all dismantled furniture components using suitable materials such as stretch film, bubble wrap',1.00,450.00,450.00),(76,23,'Network Works:  Supply and installation of 1 × 8-port network switch. Relocation and installation of 6 data points (CAT6). Installation of 3 telephone points. Complete cable routing, dressing, labeling, and termination.  Necessary modifications and adjustments to the existing network rack. ncluding wiring, fixing, testing, and safe termination for each workstation.',1.00,1325.00,1325.00),(77,23,'Electrical Works: Supply and installation of 6 double power sockets. Including wiring, fixing, testing, and safe termination for each workstation.',1.00,450.00,450.00),(79,25,'Light replacement work at 1st floor, including removal of existing faulty light fittings and supply & installation of new lights, complete with testing',1.00,500.00,500.00),(85,5,'Networking',1.00,1600.00,1600.00),(86,2,'Supply and laying of CAT6 data cable from the server/NVR room to each CCTV camera location.',14.00,125.00,1750.00),(87,2,'supply  ip camara dome',12.00,75.00,900.00),(88,2,'HDD',1.00,550.00,550.00),(89,2,'20 channel NVR with Poe',1.00,1120.00,1120.00),(90,2,'Supply  focal cemara for cash counter',2.00,225.00,450.00),(91,2,'Configuration & System Setup , Cemera Installation  Initial system configuration of  NVR  Camera channel setup and naming  Date & time configuration  Recordi